      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "A s\xE9ance is a ritual designed to connect with the dead through focused
    intention, a controlled atmosphere and a symbolic tool.\n\nWhen conducted right,
    it's an effective way to contact spirits. If done incorrectly, you need to beware,
    as you can unleash unwanted entities. If you do, focus on your intention, allow
    those you're trying to contact in, if they're unwanted, KEEP THEM OUT!\n\nHow
    To Contact The Dead:\n\nStep 1: Light The Candles, they will try blow them out
    but you must keep them lit!\nStep 2: Focus On Your Intentions, clear your mind
    and only think of the person you wish to contact\nStep 3: Most importantly, KEEP
    THE BAD GHOSTS OUT!\n\nGhosts that glow red are Demons: shut the door to banish
    them!\nGhosts that glow blue are spirits: they're timid, look at them and they'll
    go away.\n\nGhosts that glow white are pure spirits, let them in."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
